WEBVTT

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.890
Who is it?

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.670
Those clothes. Are you a thief?

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:30.400
Sorry, but there is nothing of value here.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.610
I have no regrets in this world.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.580
Buddha, I will now come to your side.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:41.350
No regrets? You jest.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.890
Jihou, what did you wish for?

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:49.790
I wished to right this merciless world with the words of Buddha.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:50.860
That's right.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.530
However, no one in the Light Palace even bothered with Buddhism.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.970
In exchange, they listen to the words...

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.270
Of those <i>onmyouji.</i>

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:02.100
True. Those <i>onmyouji...</i>

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.410
If only they never existed!

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.780
Unfortunately, it is already too late.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.440
Your life's flame is about to expire.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.420
Rejoice, you will soon be beside Buddha.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:18.050
Congratulations. You can wait for Nirvana without regret.

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:20.460
No. I cannot die yet!

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:25.390
If I could just punish those <i>onmyouji...</i>

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:26.930
If you could?

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:32.230
I would become the devil! I would sell my soul!

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:33.900
Splendid words.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:16.940
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:24.950
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:32.160
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:41.190
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:50.550
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:58.360
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:06.290
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:16.300
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:22.440
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:26.970
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.980
"1/10TH"

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:39.290
What is that?! Was that a dog?

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:42.800
Yes, I'm sure they had it imported from a foreign country.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:46.030
This area is living quarters of aristocrats.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.300
From a foreign country?

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.040
I see. How extravagant.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.940
And, at the corner of such extravagance,

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:58.110
arrogantly stands the house of the lower-ranking <i>onmyouji.</i>

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.980
The house of lower-ranking <i>onmyouji</i> is quite grand.

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:05.720
This place operates on the taxes that they take from the people.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:09.760
Hey! Leave this place!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.330
This place is restricted.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:12.060
There!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:12.890
Huh?!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.230
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>?!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.900
We apologize for our rudeness!

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:19.170
It's fine. It's fine. 'Tis not a problem.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.300
'Tis?

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.840
She's making fun of Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.770
Come, servants.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.990
Hey, the barrier!

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.020
Yasunori-<i>sama.</i>

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:38.420
The mansion is completely empty.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:43.520
There is evidence that many were here until just last night,

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:46.430
but for some reason everyone has disappeared.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.130
Perhaps they were all taken by an evil spirit...

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:50.930
Don't say stupid things.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:54.000
We are not weak enough to be taken by something like that.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.000
Right!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:05:00.540
After all, the mighty <i>onmyouji</i> are invincible and afraid of nothing.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:04.710
They can eat delicious sweets like this as much as they want!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.780
Kiyome.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.980
Who are you?! How did you get in?!

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.350
Oh?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.620
This is?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.490
No way! So cute!

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.220
Is it a cursed item?

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:19.530
It wouldn't be interesting if the clothes were just small,

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:25.200
but this mysterious liquid really gives it a peculiar importance!

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.360
Kiyome!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:31.470
No, your name is Seimei now.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:35.380
How many years has it been since I last saw your face?

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:38.080
It has been a long time, Grandfather Kamono.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.310
Grandfather?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.820
That's the <i>onmyou</i> professor, Kamono Yasunori.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.380
You were told of him at Abeno Haruaki's mansion.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:53.490
The father of Seimei's mother,
Princess Katsurako.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:57.670
In other words, he is Seimei's other grandfather.

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:01.940
I heard you were working under a suspicious spell user.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:04.670
Your mother would cry if she heard of it on the other side.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:08.910
I hope this case has nothing to do with you.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.910
Hmph! Outrageous accusations.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.380
If that's the case, clean this up on your own.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.220
We're going home!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:20.020
We no longer have any business here!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.180
How pitiful.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.390
Hurry up and leave!

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:30.350
This isn't a place that scum like you are allowed to enter!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:35.600
Oops. My scummy hands couldn't help slipping.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.470
Y-You!

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:41.070
Those masks are so lame.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:48.920
It seems we can't depend on Seimei for this case.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.550
But, no matter how you look at it...

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.920
It's the work of a Horror...

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:55.250
As I thought!

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:00.960
I hate to say it, but there are many among the aristocrats

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.930
that do not think highly of you, Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:08.240
We believe this case to be the work of such people.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.440
Perhaps.

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:14.940
Starting tonight, I will lead the police magistrate to guard the mansion.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:19.250
Michinaga-<i>sama</i>, there is something I wish to ask you.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:24.190
Earlier, my unworthy granddaughter appeared at the scene.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:28.520
Is it truly all right to allow a person like that to roam free?

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:31.160
It is not a topic for you to speak on.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.360
However!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:36.530
Michinaga-<i>sama</i> allows her to run free for his own reasons.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:38.700
Are you dissatisfied with his answer?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:44.000
No, I apologize for overstepping my boundaries.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:58.020
It appeared, just as I expected.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.350
Yes, for just such a case,

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:04.660
I'm glad I stole a seal from Seimei's storage drawers.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:09.560
After it!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:10.630
Yes!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.530
So far, there hasn't been anything suspicious.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.240
Do not allow even a single ant onto the premises.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:18.210
Cut down anyone who looks suspicious immediately!

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.710
That is...

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.150
There you are.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.090
"Large"

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:52.380
"Large"

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.400
Huh?

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:58.870
What?

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:05.920
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.190
"Small"

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:06.850
"Large"

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.790
Hey, you! Where did you put Raiko-sama?!

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.950
Give him back!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.990
"Small"

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:27.580
Wh-What's going on?!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.410
Raiko<i>-sama</i>!

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.110
--Huh?!
--Where are you?!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.320
Kintoki.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.650
When did you get so big?

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:42.320
No, I'm the one who has gotten small!

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.160
Don't come this way, Kintoki!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.570
Kintoki! You bastard!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:59.510
Huh? For a moment, I thought
I heard Raiko-<i>sama</i>'s voice...

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:02.740
Shit! That bastard!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.610
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.750
It's like a whirling current!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.020
I'm going to drown and die!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.840
Yes, if I keep going in this direction,

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:30.640
I should eventually reach the house.

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:34.510
That aside, everything looks quite different from this size.

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:45.790
What a giant!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:49.990
But I cannot allow myself to be eaten here! Come!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:56.460
I searched all night, but couldn't find him.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.030
Even though I was by his side...

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:04.310
That's why I told you to leave things dealing with <i>onmyouji</i> alone.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.570
Goodness.

00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:08.210
Ouch!

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:10.730
"Meanie."

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:11.210
It can't be helped. I just have to go look for him, right?

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:12.910
Really, Seimei?!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.480
What's wrong, Shiki?

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:19.150
"He is home."

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:23.260
R-Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:25.160
Um, is that you, Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.260
Y-Yes.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:30.530
Um, your size... and the soft-shell turtle?

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:33.270
Yeah, we happened to meet by chance.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.940
We fought, fist-to-fist... no, sword-to-fang as men

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:39.210
and ended up bonding in the end...

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.440
Soft-shelled turtles don't have fangs.

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:43.240
Hey!

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:43.800
Ouch!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.780
--Oh, my! So cute!
--Hey, Seimei! Stop it!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:48.720
My arm will rip off! My arm! Let me go!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:51.450
Oh, your sword has gotten small, too!

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:53.120
So nice!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:55.760
I want to make you a little display doll!

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.120
Stop it!

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.530
Don't treat Raiko-<i>sama</i> like a toy!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.430
Poor Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:07.100
I, Kintoki, will be sure to change you back to normal!

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.900
Sorry about this. Don't cry, Kintoki!

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:13.210
Darn...

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.970
You're cute, too!

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:21.250
I see, so the Horror had that kind of power...

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:23.620
Kintoki!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.590
You ripped my clothes, didn't you?!

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:30.160
I-I'm very sorry! I will sew it back up immediately!

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.830
I see.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:35.500
So that's how it is. They, too...

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.770
What? A change of clothes?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.300
But those are women clothes!

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:42.640
No! Don't you notice anything from this?

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:43.640
I see!

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:48.080
The Horror used the same power on the <i>onmyouji</i> in the mansion...

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.180
...and shrunk them all down.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:54.950
And what happened to them, Seimei?

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:59.020
What do you think is the fluid on these clothes?

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.150
Huh?

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:03.360
I believe it to be drool.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:04.860
Drool?

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:08.430
If that's the case, the human that wore those clothes...

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.430
It can't be!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.630
I'm sure your imagination is correct.

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:19.840
High Monk Jihou.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.840
Oh, Yorinobu-<i>dono.</i>

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:24.380
How are you feeling?

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:28.680
I heard you were bedridden and brought something to eat

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.380
that will give you strength.

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:36.980
Thank you very much, but I have been eating well.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:53.030
You did the prayers during my father's funeral.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:55.770
I would like to thank you again.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:14:00.980
I was on good terms with Tadano Shinbochi-<i>sama.</i>

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:05.710
What do you plan to do, now that Shinbochi-<i>sama</i> is gone?

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.180
What do you mean?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:11.620
Michinaga has been taken in by the suspicious spells of the <i>onmyouji</i>

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.690
and has lost his way.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.720
That man no longer thinks of his people.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:20.660
Well, that man has his own way of thinking...

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:22.360
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.870
You should not stay by Michinaga's side!

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:30.370
Not only the Minamoto family, but the entire capital

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.070
will be destroyed by that man.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.040
High Monk, are you all right?

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:38.070
Excuse me, I must take some medicine.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.560
High Monk, should you not see a doctor?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.830
Stop!

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.110
They give me energy.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:07.370
What are you doing, High Monk?!

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.930
You saw!

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:17.080
That form!

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.450
What?!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.790
Save the <i>onmyouji</i>?

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:28.360
That's so unlike you.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:32.900
The barrier they maintain protects the capital.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:38.240
If that disappears, the city will be overrun with Horrors.

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:39.870
Understood!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:40.940
Then, we will immediately...

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:44.610
Why choose us for this mission?

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:47.210
Even though Raiko is in this state?

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.720
What do you mean?

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:51.750
There should be other Makai Knights,

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:55.290
but we have yet to cross paths with any of them.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.490
Could it be that there is no one else?

00:15:57.490 --> 00:16:00.230
Right now, there are no other
Makai Knights in this capital.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.390
Seimei! What are you saying?!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:08.940
You say interesting things, young lady.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:13.740
Seimei, you are strongly connected to the <i>onmyouji.</i>

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:17.080
That is the only reason I chose you this time.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:17.950
But!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:21.280
Is it all right for Raiko to stay like that forever?

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:25.450
Well, he's still useless whether he's big or small.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:26.290
Hey!

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.760
Seimei!

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:30.520
Darn!

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:34.860
What shall we do?

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:37.930
The security of the <i>onmyouji</i> mansion is too tight.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.700
It will be hard to wait for the Horror there.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.670
We'll have to find out who the Horror is the hard way.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.340
We should ask around...

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:47.880
The hard way?

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.640
That's right! What's wrong with that?

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:52.150
Seimei!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.950
I-I can't breathe!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:54.780
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.690
Don't cause a scene. The people will notice.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:59.690
Stop it, Seimei!

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:01.850
Let me out of here!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:14.170
Yorinobu? What are you doing here?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.200
Yorinobu?

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.800
Oh, Brother!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.310
Oh, um...

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.570
Wh-What is going on?!

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:22.510
Even my older brother has gotten small.

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:26.350
A-And you are tucked in Seimei-<i>san</i>'s chest...

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:29.050
What are you getting red for?! Stupid.

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:32.020
Do you have business with me?

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:38.890
The ones who hold the most power in the capital are the <i>onmyouji.</i>

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:44.230
They predict disasters and control various things under Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:50.270
And behind Michinaga-<i>sama</i> is the great <i>onmyouji</i>, Abeno Haruaki.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:54.040
Seimei, it's your grandfather.
Can't you do anything about it?

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:57.410
On the other hand,
Buddhism has been taken lightly.

00:17:57.410 --> 00:18:00.050
They are given no power in politics

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:04.120
and are kept only to pray at funerals.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:09.220
High Monk Jihou did not believe this situation was good.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:14.560
Just like my departed father, he worried for the future of the capital.

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:17.560
Departed father...

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:20.300
I cannot believe it.

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:23.540
How could that man become a Horror?

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:27.780
Seimei-<i>san</i>! I beg of you, save the High Monk Jihou!

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:29.040
Seimei!

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:34.720
Goodness, I can't stand both your pleading eyes.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:38.480
As expected of siblings. They are very similar.

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:44.450
It will be dark soon.
Let's hurry the preparations.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.770
Who is it?

00:18:54.770 --> 00:19:00.340
Only Kamono-<i>sama</i> could sit in such an extravagant carriage.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:03.610
The <i>onmyou</i> professor Kamono Yasunori?

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.120
Yes, him.

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.750
Well? Do you think this will work?

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.740
Don't worry so much.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.300
What's wrong?

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.470
It seems he has taken the bait.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.590
Look!

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:43.280
High Monk Jihou! It's me, Yorinobu!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.520
Do you understand, Yorinobu?

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:52.130
He is no longer human.

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:56.060
Once someone has become a Horror, they cannot change back.

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:58.300
But, I...

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.400
The real Jihou has already been eaten.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:07.040
That is just a monster from
Makai that hides in human skin.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.340
Let's go, Raiko!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:10.710
Understood!

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:26.660
R-Raiko-<i>sama...</i>

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.600
Seimei, you!

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:36.500
Don't get flustered, this is all according to plan.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.370
This is bad...

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:41.210
Seimei, not yet?!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:46.070
If we don't hurry, I'll become like them.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.150
Take it, Raiko!

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.890
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:27.050
Yorinobu.

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:33.990
I know. We weren't able to save him. However...

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:38.400
I was unable to save father,
Tsuna, or the high monk.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:41.570
Just what can I do?

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:45.340
Either way, thank you very much for your help.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:48.640
Yorinobu!

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:00.950
Come on, get a hold of yourself.

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:04.930
I'm exhausted. Could it be because of the Horror's power?

00:22:04.930 --> 00:22:07.160
My body just won't listen to me.

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:10.130
Let me prepare something that will give you strength.

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:18.670
Let's eat it, I guess.

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:20.900
Yeah...

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:38.130
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:45.070
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:52.240
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:59.180
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:02.750
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:06.220
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:16.700
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:40.690
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:48.390
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:00.960
"Next Episode: ZANGA"

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:53.780
A light unwanted.

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:55.950
A power desired.

00:23:55.950 --> 00:24:00.320
Brilliant white silver to the outstretched hand.
